      "all_locations": "San Francisco, CA, USA",
      "long_description": "qomplement is the agentic ERP for retail and logistics companies.\r\n\r\nRetail and logistics are the industries with the highest volume of transactions in the world. POs, freight invoices, inventory updates, and shipment confirmations. Every single one still requires a person to process it manually. Their only solution has been hiring more people.\r\n\r\nLegacy ERPs were built for humans. qomplement is the agentic ERP that cuts 95% of manual work and handles 100x more transactions with the same headcount. We give procurement and operations teams superpowers: automating purchase order intake, vendor onboarding, item master updates, freight order processing, carrier invoicing, three-way matching, and inventory reconciliation.\r\n\r\nHeadquartered in San Francisco.",
